# ============================================================
# EOPW — Cloudflare redirects
# Format:  <source>  <destination>  <status>
# First match wins, evaluated top to bottom.
#
# NOTE ON URL SCHEME (verified 2026-11-09):
#   This host serves EXTENSIONLESS URLs. Every .html request returns
#   `307` to its extensionless twin — that is Cloudflare's documented
#   `html_handling: auto-trailing-slash` default, not a misconfiguration.
#   Cloudflare exposes no html_handling mode that preserves .html *and*
#   directory-index behavior, so extensionless is the scheme to adopt.
#   Therefore every destination below uses the extensionless form:
#   pointing a 301 at a .html URL would add a second hop (301 -> 307 -> 200).
#
#   A 307 means "TEMPORARY", so Google keeps the OLD .html URL as the
#   canonical and never consolidates onto the extensionless one. That is
#   why /contact, /services, /gallery and /locations/cypress-springs are
#   stuck in Search Console as "Alternate page with proper canonical tag"
#   (excluded from the index), and why that count stepped 1 -> 0 -> 2 -> 4
#   at the 2026-10-09 migration and then stayed flat.
#
#   The block below converts every .html URL to a PERMANENT 301, so the old
#   URLs retire and the extensionless ones become the canonical set.
#
#   See coverage-analysis-2026-11-09.md and gsc-analysis-2026-11-09.md §13.
# ============================================================

# --- URL scheme: retire the old .html URLs, permanently -------------
